	(text "VGS = -0.91 x VBUS (R5 100k / R6 10k): -4.3 V at 4.75 V, -19 V at 21 V (abs max 25 V)\nR7 holds SW_EN low against the CH552 reset pull-up (140 uA max -> 0.3 V)\nR10 5 mOhm: 25 mV / 0.125 W at 5 A (INA226 range 81.9 mV). U5 A0 = A1 = GND -> I2C 0x40\nJ2: pads for a 5.08 mm terminal or wires (not assembled)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
